  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "你有没有发现：一个网站第一次打开，图片一张张慢慢冒出来；关掉再打开，几乎一下就全出来了。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.166
   }
  ]
 },
 "hook-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.067,
  "audioFrames": 242,
  "duration": 252,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 253,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:hook-2",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "网络没变，网站也没变，为什么第二次快这么多？",
    "start": 0.013,
    "dur": 4.088
   },
   {
    "text": "答案就在你自己的电脑里，它有一台小冰箱。",
    "start": 4.381,
    "dur": 3.678
   }
  ]
 },
 "first-1": {
  "audioSec": 8.967,
  "audioFrames": 269,
  "duration": 277,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "first",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:first-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第一次打开网页，浏览器要跑一趟店里，把图片、脚本、样式这些东西都买回来，可能还要经过上两期讲的门店和柜台。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 8.961
   }
  ]
 },
 "first-2": {
  "audioSec": 11.533,
  "audioFrames": 346,
  "duration": 356,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 277,
  "chapter": "first",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:first-2",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "买回来以后，浏览器顺手放进冰箱存一份，这个冰箱就叫浏览器缓存。",
    "start": 0.008,
    "dur": 6.422
   },
   {
    "text": "它其实就是你电脑上的一块存储空间，专门放网页用过的东西。",
    "start": 6.71,
    "dur": 4.834
   }
  ]
 },
 "second-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.567,
  "audioFrames": 287,
  "duration": 295,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "second",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:second-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "第二次再打开，浏览器先看看冰箱：要的东西已经在里面，直接拿出来用，连门都不用出，也不用排队等柜台，所以快。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 9.564
   }
  ]
 },
 "second-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.4,
  "audioFrames": 252,
  "duration": 262,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 295,
  "chapter": "second",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:second-2",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "注意分清楚：C D N 是离你近的门店，缓存是你家里的冰箱。",
    "start": 0.011,
    "dur": 5.462
   },
   {
    "text": "门店再近，也没有打开冰箱近。",
    "start": 5.752,
    "dur": 2.653
   }
  ]
 },
 "freshness-1": {
  "audioSec": 8.667,
  "audioFrames": 260,
  "duration": 268,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "freshness",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:freshness-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "那冰箱里的东西能一直吃吗？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.573
   },
   {
    "text": "不行。",
    "start": 2.853,
    "dur": 0.614
   },
   {
    "text": "服务器给每样东西都贴了一张保质期标签，写着能放多久。",
    "start": 3.748,
    "dur": 4.92
   }
  ]
 },
 "freshness-2": {
  "audioSec": 14.133,
  "audioFrames": 424,
  "duration": 434,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 268,
  "chapter": "freshness",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:freshness-2",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "没过保质期，浏览器就放心直接用，一句话都不用问；过了保质期，就不能再直接拿了。",
    "start": 0.015,
    "dur": 7.145
   },
   {
    "text": "这张标签有长有短：常换的东西放得短，几乎不变的图标可以放很久。",
    "start": 7.44,
    "dur": 6.701
   }
  ]
 },
 "revalidate-1": {
  "audioSec": 11.333,
  "audioFrames": 340,
  "duration": 349,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "revalidate",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:revalidate-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "过期了也不一定要重新买。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.137
   },
   {
    "text": "浏览器先问店里：我这份还是原来那份吗？",
    "start": 2.417,
    "dur": 3.431
   },
   {
    "text": "要是没变，店里只回一句「没变」，冰箱里的接着用，不用再搬一遍。",
    "start": 6.129,
    "dur": 5.22
   }
  ]
 },
 "revalidate-2": {
  "audioSec": 6.8,
  "audioFrames": 204,
  "duration": 214,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 349,
  "chapter": "revalidate",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:revalidate-2",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "要是变了，才重新下载新的。",
    "start": -0.004,
    "dur": 2.255
   },
   {
    "text": "网站更新时干脆换个文件名，旧货自然就不用了。",
    "start": 2.53,
    "dur": 4.274
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "audioSec": 13.1,
  "audioFrames": 393,
  "duration": 402,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:recap-1",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "放在一起看：浏览器缓存是你家的冰箱，最近，能不出门就不出门；C D N 是附近的门店，离你近；负载均衡是店里多开的柜台，人多也不怕。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 13.116
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.1,
  "audioFrames": 243,
  "duration": 253,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 402,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "mimo",
  "voice": "冰糖",
  "scale": 1,
  "source": "/workspace/share/ep7-timing.json:recap-2",
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "三层一起用，网站才能又快又稳。",
    "start": -0.004,
    "dur": 3.098
   },
   {
    "text": "下次网页再打开就秒出图，你就知道，是冰箱在帮忙。",
    "start": 3.374,
    "dur": 4.713
   }
  ]
 }
}